          "sourceFilename": "2914_minimum_number_of_changes_to_make_binary_string_beautiful.java",
          "code": "class Solution {\n  public int minChanges(String s) {\n    int changes = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i+=2) {\n      changes += s.charAt(i) != s.charAt(i+1) ? 1 : 0;\n    }\n    return changes;\n  }\n}\n",
